## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

The single axis is a continuous violet-leaf silk: literal Violet Leaf Absolute, Parmavert, AIM, and restrained Beta Ionone move from cool green opening into transparent cedar. Ginger and vetiver remain audible; lipstick iris, powder, and cucumber dominance are explicit failures. TARGET / IDEAL remains separate in `../candidates/LH-06.json`.

